.git
.github
.depot
.husky
.nx
.t3
.next
.turbo
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
# ...but a directory under `src/` called `build` is a Next route segment, not
# build output, and `**/build` above was silently deleting three of them from
# every image this repository has ever produced:
#
#   src/app/api/internal/build/deploy            the build worker's deploy
#                                                callback — the route that
#                                                turns a finished build into a
#                                                deployed site
#   src/app/api/team/projects/[id]/changes/[changeId]/build
#   src/app/api/admin/projects/[id]/changes/[changeId]/build
#
# Nothing failed at build time: `next build` simply compiled an app without
# those routes, the image passed its health check, and the route answered a
# plain HTML 404 to the one caller that needed it. Found on 2026-09-15 by
# probing /api/internal/build/deploy on the staging slot while bringing the
# build worker up on fs-sites-01 — `.next/server/app/api/internal/` contained
# `policy` and nothing else.
#
# The blanket rules stay: stray output anywhere is still worth excluding, and
# `src/` is the one place where a directory with that name is certainly
# source. deploy/hetzner-staging/Dockerfile asserts these files are present in
# the build context, so a future pattern that strips them again fails the
# image build instead of shipping a quietly incomplete app.
!**/src/**/build
!**/src/**/build/**
**/.cache
**/*.log
.local
coverage
**/coverage
.tmp
tmp
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
artifacts
e2e
docs
flowstarter
readiness
supabase
apps/flowstarter-editor
# The library workspace is excluded except for the two pieces the `previews`
# stage of deploy/hetzner-staging/Dockerfile needs: its package.json, so
# `pnpm install --filter @flowstarter/library` can resolve astro, and the Astro
# templates it builds. reference/, showcase/ and mcp-server/ stay out.
apps/flowstarter-library/**
!apps/flowstarter-library/package.json
!apps/flowstarter-library/templates/**
apps/flowstarter-library/templates/**/node_modules/**
apps/flowstarter-library/templates/**/.astro/**
apps/flowstarter-library/templates/**/dist/**
# Excluded except for the four templates the `templates` stage of
# deploy/hetzner-staging/Dockerfile installs and ships for the discovery
# funnel's preview build (static-preview-build.ts): creative-portfolio,
# local-trade, professional-services, wellness-therapy. dorin-portfolio
# (legacy) and demo-coach (editor dev fixture) stay out — neither is a
# template a generated site can be built from, see TEMPLATE_CATALOG in
# packages/agentic-codegen/src/workspace.ts.
apps/flowstarter-templates/**
!apps/flowstarter-templates/creative-portfolio/**
!apps/flowstarter-templates/local-trade/**
!apps/flowstarter-templates/professional-services/**
!apps/flowstarter-templates/wellness-therapy/**
apps/flowstarter-templates/*/node_modules/**
apps/flowstarter-templates/*/.astro/**
apps/flowstarter-templates/*/dist/**
apps/flowstarter-selfserve
apps/shopify-landing
apps/deploy-agent
